{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34171","headline":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 包山祠 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 包山祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静境林麓好，古祠烟霭浓。\n自非通灵才，敢陟羣仙峰。\n百里波浪沓，中堂箫鼓重。\n真君具琼舆，髣髴来相从。\n清露濯巢鸟，阴云生昼龙。\n风飘橘柚香，日动旛盖容。\n将命礼且洁，所祈年不凶。\n终当以疏闻，特用诸侯封。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}